  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1001.11 Penalty. Any insurer or representative thereof who shall knowingly violate any provision of this part shall be subject to the provisions of RSA 400-A;15, III.\n\nSource. #1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5649, eff 7-1-93; ss and moved by #6999, eff 5-24-99 (from Ins 1001.12), EXPIRED: 5-24-07\n\nNew. #8900, eff 7-1-07 (formerly Ins 1001.16), EXPIRED: 7-1-15\n\nNew. #10962, eff 10-26-15",
